meta {
  name: Media upload
  type: http
  seq: 29
}

put {
  url: {{uploadUrl}}
  body: text
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: image/jpeg
  x-amz-checksum-sha256: {{uploadChecksum}}
}

body:text {
  fake photo for bruno
}

docs {
  The upload itself, to the storage and not to the API: the URL Media upload intent kept. No bearer token; the URL is signed. 200 from the storage. Any other body, length or type is refused by the storage (400 or 403).
}
